{"id": "1162249", "revid": "888691", "url": "https://vi.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=1162249", "title": "Danh sách loài nhện trong họ Dictynidae", "text": "Danh sách các loài nhện thuộc họ Dictynidae xếp theo chi.\nAdenodictyna.\n\"Adenodictyna\" \nAebutina.\n\"Aebutina\" \nAjmonia.\n\"Ajmonia\" \nAltella.\n\"Altella\" \nAnaxibia.\n\"Anaxibia\" \nArangina.\n\"Arangina\" \nArchaeodictyna.\n\"Archaeodictyna\" \nArctella.\n\"Arctella\" \nArgenna.\n\"Argenna\" \nArgennina.\n\"Argennina\" \nAtelolathys.\n\"Atelolathys\" \nBanaidja.\n\"Banaidja\" \nBlabomma.\n\"Blabomma\" \nBrommella.\n\"Brommella\" \nCallevophthalmus.\n\"Callevophthalmus\" \nChaerea.\n\"Chaerea\" \nChorizomma.\n\"Chorizomma\" \nCicurina.\n\"Cicurina\" \nDevade.\n\"Devade\" \nDictyna.\n\"Dictyna\" \nDictynomorpha.\n\"Dictynomorpha\" \nEmblyna.\n\"Emblyna\" \nHackmania.\n\"Hackmania\" \nHelenactyna.\n\"Helenactyna\" \nHoplolathys.\n\"Hoplolathys\" \nIviella.\n\"Iviella\" \nLathys.\n\"Lathys\" \nMallos.\n\"Mallos\" \nMarilynia.\n\"Marilynia\" \nMashimo.\n\"Mashimo\" \nMastigusa.\n\"Mastigusa\" \nMexitlia.\n\"Mexitlia\" \nMizaga.\n\"Mizaga\" \nNigma.\n\"Nigma\" \nParadictyna.\n\"Paradictyna\" \nPenangodyna.\n\"Penangodyna\" \nPhantyna.\n\"Phantyna\" \nQiyunia.\n\"Qiyunia\" \nRhion.\n\"Rhion\" \nSaltonia.\n\"Saltonia\" \nScotolathys.\n\"Scotolathys\" \nShango.\n\"Shango\" \nSudesna.\n\"Sudesna\" \nTahuantina.\n\"Tahuantina\" \nTandil.\n\"Tandil\" \nThallumetus.\n\"Thallumetus\" \nTivyna.\n\"Tivyna\" \nTricholathys.\n\"Tricholathys\" \nViridictyna.\n\"Viridictyna\" \nYorima.\n\"Yorima\" "}
